    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d324">

                <pb facs="0825" n="703" sameAs="frus:frus1889/pg703"/>

                <head><hi rendition="#italic">Mr. Kloss to Mr. Blaine.</hi></head>
                <opener><seg rendition="#center">[Translation.]</seg></opener>
                <opener><dateline rendition="#float-right"><placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >Legation of Switzerland</hi>,<lb/><hi rendition="#italic"
                                >Washington</hi></placeName>, <date calendar="gregorian"
                            when="1889-08-13"><hi rendition="#italic">August</hi> 13, 1889</date>.
                        (Received August 14.)</dateline></opener>
                <p><hi rendition="#small-caps">Sir</hi>: I have the honor to acknowledge the receipt
                    of your esteemed note of the 5th instant, in which you were so kind as to
                    inclose a copy of a report of July 31 from the Secretary of the Treasury
                    concerning the refusal of the competent authorities at New York to allow certain
                    Swiss citizens to land there.</p>
                <pb facs="0826" n="704" xml:id="pg704"/>
                <p>While I have the honor to thank you warmly for the trouble which you have taken,
                    I take the liberty of requesting you to convey my best thanks to the Secretary
                    of the Treasury also for the kind interest which he has taken in the
                    investigation of the case. I am, furthermore, much obliged to him for having
                    given the necessary instructions, as appears by the said report, in order that
                    all future cases of the same kind, in which Swiss citizens are concerned, may be
                    promptly communicated to the Swiss consul at New York.</p>
                <p>Accept, etc.,</p>
                <closer><signed><hi rendition="#small-caps">K. Kloss.</hi></signed></closer>
            </div>
        </body>
    </text>
